# BeBee

> International job portal and professional network connecting job seekers, freelancers, recruiters, and service providers across 99 countries.

## About

BeBee is a platform for employment and freelance services. It connects:

- Job seekers with job offers across multiple countries and industries
- Freelancers with service requests from clients
- Recruiters with qualified candidates
- Service providers with people who need professional services

## Key Features

- Job search with filters by location, industry, salary, contract type, and remote work
- Professional profiles with skills, experience, and portfolio
- Salary guides with data by profession, industry, and country
- Freelance marketplace for service requests and proposals
- Messaging system for direct communication
- Multi-language support: English, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Italian

## Coverage

BeBee operates in 99 countries across Europe, North America, Central America, South America, Middle East, Africa, and Asia-Pacific.

